/* Xurface Discern - localisation.
 *
 * The ten most spoken languages, Arabic right to left. A person deciding
 * whether an agent may spend their money or publish their work has to read the
 * question in their own language; a half-translated consent screen is not
 * consent. So every visible string lives here, including the reasons an action
 * needs discernment - Horizon sends those as structured risk plus appetite, and
 * we phrase them locally rather than shipping English through.
 */
